  "notes": [
    "Pending with statistics_eligible=true DOES count; status is a filter, not blanket exclusion.",
    "Refund already has expense economic type and positive signed amount. Sum -40.00 + 15.00 = -25.00.",
    "A dated nonstatistical/transfer/missing-money row creates an empty month in all plus its own status; missing instant creates no month.",
    "Order months descending, currencies ascending, statuses all/pending/confirmed.",
    "Strict exact money text retains Decimal scale/scientific rendering where applicable. Boundary expected text computed with standalone Python decimal precision80.",
    "Invalid timezone must fail even for empty rows, never fallback to UTC.",
    "Use the same plan ID read UTC then Shanghai then UTC to test timezone-specific cache keys, without regenerating plan.",
    "Presentation timezone cannot alter row instants, financial facts, preview selections or commit body."
  ]
